B.abA=new A.vH("Humming","Humming creates vibrations that directly stimulate the vagus nerve through the larynx. Even 2 minutes can measurably shift your state.","Find a comfortable note and hum steadily. Feel the vibration in your chest and throat. Let the exhale extend naturally as you hum.",B.qz,null)
B.aby=new A.vH("Gargling","Gargling activates muscles at the back of the throat that are connected to the vagus nerve. 30 seconds is enough to notice a shift.","Take a mouthful of water and gargle vigorously for as long as comfortable. Repeat 2-3 times.",B.li,30)
B.abz=new A.vH("Extended Exhale","The exhale activates the parasympathetic nervous system. Making your exhale twice as long as your inhale slows the heart rate and signals safety to your body.","Breathe in for 4 counts. Breathe out slowly for 8 counts. There is no hold \u2014 just a long, steady out-breath. Repeat as many times as you need.",B.eu,null)
B.qs=new A.b_(63279,!1)
B.abx=new A.vH("Diving Reflex","Submerging your face in cold water (or splashing it) triggers the mammalian diving reflex \u2014 your heart rate slows within seconds. It is one of the fastest calming signals your body responds to.","Fill a bowl or sink with cold water. Hold your breath and submerge your face for 15-30 seconds, or splash cold water repeatedly over your face and forehead.",B.qs,30)
B.r2=A.a(s([B.abA,B.aby,B.abz,B.abx]),A.ad("u<vH>"))
B.a9X=new A.qz(5,"See","Look around you. Find 5 things you can see right now.\n\nTake your time. Notice each one clearly \u2014 colour, shape, texture.",B.qB)
B.Ob=new A.b_(63457,!1)
B.a9Y=new A.qz(4,"Hear","Close your eyes if that feels safe. Find 4 things you can hear.\n\nNear and far. Notice the sounds without judgement.",B.Ob)
B.aa_=new A.qz(3,"Touch","Find 3 things you can feel right now \u2014 the chair beneath you, the fabric on your skin, the air temperature.\n\nPress your feet into the floor if that helps.",B.lh)
B.a9Z=new A.qz(2,"Smell","Find 2 things you can smell, or remember scents that feel safe and familiar to you.\n\nTake a slow breath in through your nose.",B.qA)
B.Ow=new A.b_(984725,!1)
B.aa0=new A.qz(1,"Taste","Notice 1 thing you can taste, or take a sip of water if you have some.\n\nYou are here. You are safe.",B.Ow)
